<IndustryPage {...pageData}>
<p>Financial services firms in the UK operate in one of the most regulated environments in the world. Compliance burdens are growing, client expectations are rising, and margins are under pressure. Bespoke software can help you automate compliance, streamline operations, and deliver the digital experience clients now expect - but many firms are still managing regulatory obligations through spreadsheets and manual processes that are both error-prone and impossible to audit comprehensively.</p>
<p>Off-the-shelf financial software rarely fits the reality of a modern UK financial services firm. Generic CRM systems don't understand suitability records or client risk profiling. Portfolio management platforms handle standard instruments but struggle with alternative investments, structured products, or bespoke client mandates. Compliance tools built for large banks are priced out of reach for independent wealth managers and boutique advisory firms, while consumer-grade tools lack the audit trails and access controls that regulation demands. The gap between what firms need and what they can buy is widening.</p>
<p>We build custom software for UK financial services firms that's secure, compliant, and practical. We understand FCA regulation, MiFID II, and the compliance landscape, and we build systems that integrate with your existing infrastructure - from portfolio management platforms to back-office systems. Whether it's automating regulatory reporting, building a client onboarding workflow with embedded KYC and AML checks, or creating a secure client portal with real-time portfolio visibility, bespoke software fits your specific regulatory and operational requirements.</p>
<p>Compliance in financial services leaves no room for error. Bespoke software can automate transaction reporting under MiFID II, maintain complete audit trails for every client interaction, enforce segregation of duties through role-based access control, and generate FCA-ready compliance reports on demand. Data encryption at rest and in transit, coupled with UK-based hosting, ensures your systems meet the security expectations of regulators and clients alike.</p>
<p>A UK wealth management firm managing £400 million in client assets engaged us after their off-the-shelf CRM couldn't produce the suitability records required under FCA COBS rules. We built a bespoke client management system that captured risk profiles, recorded suitability assessments with full audit trails, and automated annual review scheduling. The firm passed their next FCA visit without a single data request outstanding, and their compliance team reduced time spent on record retrieval from days to minutes.</p>
<p>From compliance automation and regulatory reporting to client onboarding and portfolio management tools, bespoke software is already delivering real ROI for forward-thinking UK financial services firms. The opportunity is building software that turns regulatory burden into competitive advantage.</p>

